<section class="section faq-section" id="faq"><span class="section-label" data-reveal>A FEW LITTLE ANSWERS</span><div class="faq-grid"><h2 data-reveal>Good questions.<br>Simple answers.</h2><div data-reveal><details><summary>Where are my notes saved?<span>+</span></summary><p>Your notes are saved locally in this browser on this device. Export a backup before clearing browser data. Cross-device sync is planned for Plus.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to create an account?<span>+</span></summary><p>No account needed for the free workspace. Just start writing. Your notes stay in the browser you use.</p></details><details><summary>Can I take my notes with me?<span>+</span></summary><p>Absolutely. Use Export in your workspace to download all your notes as a text file, anytime.</p></details></div></div></section>
